# WTDRV2U.KEY - a key script of WTDRV2: the E line found by td_ahead.
# Ctrl+B holds the script and asks for the keys typed ahead; the E line
# after it ends the run there, the window still busy, and the snapshot
# after it is never written.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WTDRV2U.SNP is its
# snapshot.
S INIT
K CTRL-B
E
S NEVER
